## Energetics Model
- Baseline BMR: 1,737 kcal (Mifflin-St Jeor) / 1,727 kcal (Katch-McArdle)
- Baseline TDEE: 2,875–2,920 kcal/day (NEAT ~480 kcal @ 8.5k–10k steps, TEF ~265 kcal, EAT ~478 kcal)
- By Week 21: Mifflin-St Jeor BMR drops to 1,657 kcal, but Katch-McArdle BMR rises to 1,791 kcal (+64 kcal/day) due to +6.2 lbs LBM expansion, supporting a 2,500 kcal permanent maintenance floor
- Protein 1.23–1.33 g/lb target LBM (180–195 g/day); fat floor ≥70 g/day; carbs never below 185 g/day

## Critical Diagnostic Rule (Weeks 1–3 ICW Buffer)
During Weeks 1–3, 5g/day creatine and myonuclear domain re-inflation pull +3.8 lbs of intracellular water and glycogen into muscle cells. Scale weight may hover at 187.5–188.5 lbs for the first 14–21 days despite fat loss. **NEVER cut calories during Weeks 1–3 if navel waist is tightening.**

## Hard Guardrails
- Zero GLP-1 agonists
- Enforce ≥100g protein (target 110–125g) before 5:00 PM daily (absolute clock — evening food-noise firewall)
- Enforce pre-meal unflavored psyllium husk (2.5g Adaptation in Wk 1; 5.0g Operational in Wks 2–21) in 12 oz water + 6 oz chaser 15–20 min before Lunch and Dinner (never within 2 hrs of BJJ; **never within ±2 hrs of 3:00 PM sertraline** — lunch fiber ≈12:40 PM / lunch ≈1:00 PM)
- Derive 65–75% of non-peri-workout carbs from Milpa resistant starches (cooked black/pinto beans, nixtamalized corn tortillas)
- Zero-lactose whey only; Kirkland multi only at lunch; Mg stack 60 min pre-bed; allergy med at lights-out

## Training Architecture Invariants
- 2×/week MED lifting (<50 min), RPE curve per `protocols/lifts_registry.md`
- 2×/week Zone 2 cycling 45 min @ 125–138 bpm
- Tue/Fri midday lifts only; **Monday is errands/family NEAT with wife off — never a lift day**
- Mon/Tue/Thu evening BJJ when schedule allows; Sat open mat afternoon by default
- Lift→mat separation ≥4–6 hours (late-wake yields ~5.5–6.5 hr on Tue); never add a “makeup” Monday lift

## Trajectory Realism
Week-21 milestones in `protocols/milestones.csv` are **aspirational (Tier B→C)**. Score wins against Tier A floor first — see `protocols/trajectory_realism.md`. Full “stocky” density often consolidates in Wk 22–30 maintenance, not on the Wk 21 scale day. Never deepen the deficit solely because LBM/stockiness lags while waist is moving.

